[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4275216314","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118739#issuecomment-4275216314","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118739","id":4275216314,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-0p-6","user":{"login":"joelriendeau","id":475850,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTg1MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/475850?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelriendeau","html_url":"https://github.com/joelriendeau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelriendeau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelriendeau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelriendeau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelriendeau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelriendeau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelriendeau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelriendeau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelriendeau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelriendeau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-19T05:05:13Z","updated_at":"2026-04-19T05:05:13Z","body":"For the forward renderer, I believe the fix is adding a call to `pipeline_hash_map.clear_pipelines();` in `SceneShaderForwardClustered::ShaderData::set_code` in the branch for `if (err != OK)` :\n`if (err != OK) {\n\tpipeline_hash_map.clear_pipelines(); <-- This here\n\tif (version.is_valid()) {\n\t\tSceneShaderForwardClustered::singleton->shader.version_free(version);\n\t\tversion = RID();\n\t}\n\tERR_FAIL_MSG(\"Shader compilation failed.\");\n}`\n\nbecause otherwise the early exit from ERR_FAIL_MSG skips clearing the pipelines, which contain RIDs that will be destroyed by `SceneShaderForwardClustered::singleton->shader.version_free(version);`. When the shader is fixed and set_code is called again, the non-skipped normal call to `pipeline_hash_map.clear_pipelines();` tries to free RIDs that were deleted by the earlier `SceneShaderForwardClustered::singleton->shader.version_free(version);`\n\nIf that sounds right, I can provide the fix as a pull request.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4275216314/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5179801843","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118739#issuecomment-5179801843","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118739","id":5179801843,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNL2A8w","user":{"login":"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-04T13:34:28Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T13:34:28Z","body":"This continues to happen even on the latest master